<title>FRANCE: Axa, UAP deal involves share swap -source.</title>
<headline>Axa, UAP deal involves share swap -source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A planned alliance between French insurers Axa and UAP is based on a share swap deal, an industry source said.</p>
<p>The alliance was announced on Tuesday morning by the firms but neither would give any detail ahead of a news conference which Axa said would take place at 1200 GMT.</p>
</text>
